        "original_id": "d8cae6da-423c-54d3-a2c0-6326d57e8c0e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Jennings, Lee Cheol-ha, Nick Goldsmith, Moon Geun-young, Kim Joo-hyuk\n- Organizations: Hammer & Tongs\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, actor\n- Works: Love Me Not\n- Places: Britain, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Garth Jennings, born in 1972, is a British film director, screenwriter, producer, and actor.\n- Hammer & Tongs is the pseudonym of British director and producer duo Garth Jennings and Nick Goldsmith.\n- Hammer & Tongs is also the name of the production company associated with Garth Jennings and Nick Goldsmith.\n- Lee Cheol-ha is a South Korean film director known for stylish portraits of the human experience.\n- Love Me Not is a 2006 South Korean romance film directed by Lee Cheol-ha.\n- Love Me Not stars Moon Geun-young and Kim Joo-hyuk.\n- Love Me Not literally means \"Love and Such Is Not Necessary.\"",
